.SS "docutils\&.parsers\&.rst\&.directives\&.single_char_or_unicode ( argument)"

.PP
.nf
A single character is returned as-is\&.  Unicode character codes are
converted as in `unicode_code`\&.  (Directive option conversion function\&.)

.fi
.PP
 
.SS "docutils\&.parsers\&.rst\&.directives\&.single_char_or_whitespace_or_unicode ( argument)"

.PP
.nf
As with `single_char_or_unicode`, but 'tab' and 'space' are also supported\&.
(Directive option conversion function\&.)

.fi
.PP
 
.SS "docutils\&.parsers\&.rst\&.directives\&.unchanged ( argument)"

.PP
.nf
Return the argument text, unchanged\&.
(Directive option conversion function\&.)

No argument implies empty string ('')\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.SS "docutils\&.parsers\&.rst\&.directives\&.unchanged_required ( argument)"

.PP
.nf
Return the argument text, unchanged\&.
(Directive option conversion function\&.)

Raise ``ValueError`` if no argument is found\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.SS "docutils\&.parsers\&.rst\&.directives\&.unicode_code ( code)"

.PP
.nf
Convert a Unicode character code to a Unicode character\&.
(Directive option conversion function\&.)

Codes may be decimal numbers, hexadecimal numbers (prefixed by ``0x``,
``x``, ``\\x``, ``U+``, ``u``, or ``\\u``; e\&.g\&. ``U+262E``), or XML-style
numeric character entities (e\&.g\&. ``&#x262E;``)\&.  Other text remains as-is\&.

Raise ValueError for illegal Unicode code values\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.SS "docutils\&.parsers\&.rst\&.directives\&.uri ( argument)"

.PP
.nf
Return the URI argument with unescaped whitespace removed\&.
(Directive option conversion function\&.)

Raise ``ValueError`` if no argument is found\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.SS "docutils\&.parsers\&.rst\&.directives\&.value_or ( values,  other)"

.PP
.nf
Directive option conversion function\&.

The argument can be any of `values` or `argument_type`\&.

.fi
